{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fallen friendship, a stolen love.<br>To rescue the beloved woman taken by his closest friend,<br>a jet-black avenger cuts through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate-Speed \u00d7 Hardcore Runner</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carve through enemy lines with the Quick Slash!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An overwhelming sense of exhilaration with simple controls just lock onto an enemy and press the attack button.<br>Become a gust of wind and slice through hordes of yokai with lightning-fast sword techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/d1f7d776f7cc6675f131233c2d51e77d.poster.avif?t=1771585290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/d1f7d776f7cc6675f131233c2d51e77d.webm?t=1771585290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/d1f7d776f7cc6675f131233c2d51e77d.mp4?t=1771585290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn more time with the ultimate move Gale Rush!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the moon sets and the sun rises, the forbidden ritual will make everything irreversible.<br>Yet only one minute remains until dawn.<br>Secret art Gale Rush extends the time until sunrise by consuming the souls of enemies with each strike.<br>Being surrounded by many enemies is not only a crisis it is also an opportunity.<br>Keep struggling never give up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/2ce63493aff36cc0786059facff59e45.poster.avif?t=1771585290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/2ce63493aff36cc0786059facff59e45.webm?t=1771585290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/2ce63493aff36cc0786059facff59e45.mp4?t=1771585290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse and flexible actions to overcome any obstacle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience ultra-high-speed action like a hero from manga or anime.<br>Leap past enemies and obstacles with style \u2014 and aim for the fastest run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/e15aa8c527e9beb31b9528ebcf5873f8.poster.avif?t=1771585290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/e15aa8c527e9beb31b9528ebcf5873f8.webm?t=1771585290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/e15aa8c527e9beb31b9528ebcf5873f8.mp4?t=1771585290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat formidable enemies with Flash Storm!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even powerful foes that cannot be defeated with a normal Flash Slash can be taken down using Flash Storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed in the input within the time limit,\u00a0and Hayate will tear through enemies at blinding speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in a thrilling, high-impact action sequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/d3c82bd0852b32cf8ac28e60d19c8aff.poster.avif?t=1771585290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/d3c82bd0852b32cf8ac28e60d19c8aff.webm?t=1771585290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/d3c82bd0852b32cf8ac28e60d19c8aff.mp4?t=1771585290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strengthen the protagonist and overwhelm your enemies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your character using Soul Stones obtained by clearing stages.<br>Master the powerful actions unlocked through Skills and race through the Underworld!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/dfe03283960c04eb82a8f3965aa07aff.poster.avif?t=1771585290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/dfe03283960c04eb82a8f3965aa07aff.webm?t=1771585290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/dfe03283960c04eb82a8f3965aa07aff.mp4?t=1771585290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep running until the very last moment!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3272710?t=1771585290","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771585290","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/0bace4d5b6f4f0546d15cefb93c52cf6baff4574/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771585290","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/0bace4d5b6f4f0546d15cefb93c52cf6baff4574/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=177158